status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CITIZEN WATCH CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>EGAWA SHUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CITIZEN WATCH CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EGAWA, SHUNJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>EGAWA SHUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EGAWA, SHUNJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A radiation clinical thermometer capable of measuring the body temperature more accurately than conventional by considering the infrared radiation emitted from the end of a probe part and reflected by the ear drum and external canal. The thermometer has temperature calculating means for calculating the body temperature according to a predetermined calculation equation based on the emissivities of the ear drum and external canal which are below one, the output of infrared sensing means, and the output of temperature measuring means.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un thermomètre médical de rayonnement qui peut mesurer la température du corps de manière plus précise qu'un thermomètre classique en considérant le rayon infrarouge émis depuis l'extrémité d'une sonde et renvoyé par la membrane du tympan et le canal externe. Le thermomètre dispose d'un organe de calcul de la température qui permet de calculer la température du corps conformément à une équation de calcul prédéterminée se rapportant aux propriétés émissives de la membrane du tympan et du canal externe qui se trouvent en dessous de un. Cela concerne également la sortie du capteur infrarouge et la sortie du dispositif de mesure de la température.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>